KPL/IK

Juno JIRAM Instrument Kernel
===============================================================================

   This Instrument Kernel (IK) file contains optics and detector parameters
   and FOV definitions for the JUNO Jupiter InfraRed Auroral Mapper (JIRAM)
   instrument.


Version and Date
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Version 0.1 -- June 15, 2017 -- Boris Semenov, NAIF

      Filled in Instrument Description based on [6].

   Version 0.1 -- September 10, 2014 -- Boris Semenov, NAIF

      Updated IFOV, FOV angular extents, first and last pixel positions
      wrt to the FOV, and JIRAM/I line count based on the information
      provided by Alessandro Mura, INAF-IAPS on September 9, 2014.

   Version 0.0 -- June 9, 2009 -- Boris Semenov, NAIF

      Initial Release.


